Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:07.05,LyricJA,op-lyrics::001-ja,0,0,0,,全て失くした場所で
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:07.05,Lyric,op-lyrics::001,0,0,0,,모든 걸 잃어버린 그곳에서
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:12.80,LyricJA,op-lyrics::002-ja,0,0,0,,もう一度取り戻すから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:12.80,Lyric,op-lyrics::002,0,0,0,,다시 되찾을 테니까
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:34.85,LyricJA,op-lyrics::003-ja,0,0,0,,冷たい光が時を止める
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:34.85,Lyric,op-lyrics::003,0,0,0,,차가운 빛이 시간을 멈추고
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:38.65,LyricJA,op-lyrics::004-ja,0,0,0,,影さえ凍る in darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:38.65,Lyric,op-lyrics::004,0,0,0,,그림자마저 얼어붙는 어둠 속
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:42.25,LyricJA,op-lyrics::005-ja,0,0,0,,彷徨う孤独な金の瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:42.25,Lyric,op-lyrics::005,0,0,0,,외로이 헤매는 금빛 눈동자
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:46.10,LyricJA,op-lyrics::006-ja,0,0,0,,欠けてく錆びた銀の月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:46.10,Lyric,op-lyrics::006,0,0,0,,녹슨 은빛 달은 이지러져 가네
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.05,LyricJA,op-lyrics::007-ja,0,0,0,,融けて消えた線なぞり
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.05,Lyric,op-lyrics::007,0,0,0,,녹아 사라진 선을 더듬으며
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:53.95,LyricJA,op-lyrics::008-ja,0,0,0,,夢見た明日を辿る
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:53.95,Lyric,op-lyrics::008,0,0,0,,꿈꾸던 내일을 따라가
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:57.95,LyricJA,op-lyrics::009-ja,0,0,0,,深く刻んで伸びた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:57.95,Lyric,op-lyrics::009,0,0,0,,깊이 새겨져 길게 뻗은
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.00,LyricJA,op-lyrics::010-ja,0,0,0,,過ちの跡 越えて奔る
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.00,Lyric,op-lyrics::010,0,0,0,,잘못의 흔적을 넘어 달려가
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:09.25,LyricJA,op-lyrics::011-ja,0,0,0,,全て失くした場所で
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:09.25,Lyric,op-lyrics::011,0,0,0,,모든 걸 잃어버린 그곳에서
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:13.12,LyricJA,op-lyrics::012-ja,0,0,0,,もう一度掴む ただひとつ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:13.12,Lyric,op-lyrics::012,0,0,0,,다시 붙잡을 거야, 단 하나
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:16.95,LyricJA,op-lyrics::013-ja,0,0,0,,守りたかったものを
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:16.95,Lyric,op-lyrics::013,0,0,0,,지키고 싶었던 것을
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:19.95,LyricJA,op-lyrics::014-ja,0,0,0,,そう二度と放さない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:19.95,Lyric,op-lyrics::014,0,0,0,,그래, 두 번 다시 놓지 않아
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:24.90,LyricJA,op-lyrics::015-ja,0,0,0,,見失わない 振り返らない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:24.90,Lyric,op-lyrics::015,0,0,0,,놓치지 않아, 돌아보지 않아
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:28.45,LyricJA,op-lyrics::016-ja,0,0,0,,必ず取り戻すから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:28.45,Lyric,op-lyrics::016,0,0,0,,반드시 되찾을 테니까
